<Item XName="Notes" UserName="Notes" Type="Notes">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>&lt;P align=center&gt;&lt;FONT color=#ff0000 face=&quot;Agilent TT Cond&quot;&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Antenna Pattern&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face=Simsun&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Agilent TT Cond&quot;&gt;This example show how to generate the antenna pattern based on imported Antenna pattern, with RADAR_AntennaPolarizationTx model . (RADAR_AntennaPolarizationRx is another model which is used at the receiver). &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Agilent TT Cond&quot;&gt;Two MATLAB Script models are used to scan the elevation and azimuth angles of main beam in order to get the antenna pattern.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Agilent TT Cond&quot;&gt;The different weighting window functions and scan mode can be selected from the parameter list.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Agilent TT Cond&quot;&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Agilent TT Cond&quot;&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face=&quot;Agilent TT Cond&quot;&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;</Text>
<Item XName="Page" Type="PageMgr">
<Item XName="Display0" Type="NotesDisp">
<DVport><T>Array_Dbl64</T><D>1;4;;;Od14;mV14</D></DVport>
<PVPort><T>Array_Dbl64</T><D>1;4;;;yYmB2lG2V24;LLLLLLz4L24</D></PVPort>
<Show><T>Bool</T><D>1</D></Show>
<ShowCmd><T>Int</T><D>1</D></ShowCmd>
<Window><T>Array_I64</T><D>1;4;;O6;F3;29</D></Window>
<ZOrder><T>Int</T><D>2</D></ZOrder></Item></Item></Item>
<Item XName="Page" Type="PageMgr" /></Item>
<Item XName="Equation1" UserName="Equation1" Type="Equation">
<AutoCalc><T>Bool</T><D>1</D></AutoCalc>
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>1</D></Selected>
<Text>using(&apos;Design1_Data&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;pattern_re = real(Pattern);&#x000D;&#x000A;pattern_im = imag(Pattern);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;pattern = pattern_re + j * pattern_im;&#x000D;&#x000A;pattern_mat = reshape(pattern, 180, 180);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;theta = [-90 : 89];&#x000D;&#x000A;phi = [1 : 180];&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;g_Ant=graph_figure(&apos;3D Antenna Patturn&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;[xx,yy]=meshgrid(phi,theta);&#x000D;&#x000A;g_Ant.add_surface_data(xx,yy,abs(pattern_mat));&#x000D;&#x000A;g_Ant.set_label_y(&apos;Theta&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;g_Ant.set_label_x(&apos;Phi&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;g_Ant.set_label_z(&apos;Power&apos;);&#x000D;&#x000A;&#x000D;&#x000A;</Text>
<UnitUse><T>Int</T><D>2</D></UnitUse>
